Package: 1bit-appliance
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: 1bit <packages@1bit.gg>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: 1bit-engine (= @VERSION@), 1bit-lemonade (= @VERSION@), 1bit-archive-keyring, systemd, openssh-server, systemd-resolved, initramfs-tools
Replaces: base-files
Description: 1bit OS, Lemonade Server appliance - meta and configuration package
 Turns a minimal Ubuntu into the appliance: the units that start
 Lemonade and the engine, the console banner, autologin, the network
 and /data mount, the fans and power profile, the first-boot setup
 and the signed apt repository this box updates from. Lemonade
 Server by AMD, running on the 1bit engine.
